SF0017 Carbon dioxide-enhanced oil recovery stimulus.
Sponsored By: Joint Minerals, Business & Economic Development
Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to the administration of the government; providing an enhanced
oil recovery stimulus for the use of carbon dioxide in enhanced oil recovery;
specifying conditions and requirements for the stimulus; providing for the
administration of the stimulus; creating an account; requiring reports;
requiring transfers of funds; authorizing rulemaking; providing an
appropriation; and providing for an effective date.
