Page 5-line 3 After "January 1, 2023" insert "and subject to
subsection (c) of this section".
Page 6-line 9 After "26 U.S.C. 45Q." insert "The stimulus shall not
be available during any time that the amount of the
credit available under 26 U.S.C. 45Q for a qualified
